01:40:42,540 --> 01:40:50,547
So I started focused on City Hall, and then I started doing outreach and introduction, finally meeting people

1159
01:40:51,067 --> 01:41:08,612
bringing people into my tangled web by having a goodie box in my office with chocolates and sweets because people like food related things that are not from the US.

1160
01:41:09,132 --> 01:41:17,614
